  "descriptions": {
    "preferred": "Acer platanoides 'Erectum' Columar Norway Maple Zones 4-7 Acer platanoides ‘Erectum’ is an upright, columnar form of the Norway maple known for its strong vertical habit and symmetrical shape. Adaptable to a wide range of soils and urban conditions, it requires minimal maintenance and responds well to light pruning. In 10 years, it typically reaches 15–20 ft tall and 5 ft wide, maintaining its tidy, architectural form while providing year-round structure and seasonal interest. Acer platanoides does not ship to CT, ME, MA, and NH."
